      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Read\n**Tools: n8n form, local PDF reader**\n\nThe analyst uploads two PDFs. The figures in the accounts are read on this computer, **without AI.**",
        "width": 720,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-21",
      "name": "Note 21",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        690,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. AI reads the memo\n**Tools: Claude through OpenRouter. Backup: OpenAI**\n\nAI reads **only the memo**, and every answer must include an exact quote. If the first service is down or does not finish, the backup takes over.\n\nTo use a model on your own server, change the address here.",
        "width": 580,
        "height": 640,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-22",
      "name": "Note 22",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1290,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Check\n**Tools: plain rules, no AI**\n\nEvery quote must exist in the memo. The accounts are tested. Failed answers are left blank.",
        "width": 240,
        "height": 420,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-23",
      "name": "Note 23",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1550,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Suggest\n**Tools: Claude, backup OpenAI, then plain rules**\n\nAI proposes scores using AHL's own guide. Suggestions without verified evidence are dropped.",
        "width": 860,
        "height": 580,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-24",
      "name": "Note 24",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2430,
        60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 5. A person decides\n**Tools: n8n form**\n\nThe reviewer sees the issues, changes anything, then approves or rejects.",
        "width": 670,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-25",
      "name": "Note 25",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        3140,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 6. Fill and prove\n**Tools: Excel template, LibreOffice, no AI**\n\nFills AHL's template, recalculates it, and confirms nothing else changed. Released only if every check passes.",
        "width": 960,
        "height": 400,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-26",
      "name": "Note 26",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1290,
        660
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### If anything fails\nThe run stops, says why, and releases nothing.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 7
      }
    }
  ],
